              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Offline agents stay in the list so they aren't forgotten, but they're dimmed and can't be selected. Hovering one says why and when it was last seen. A switch attempt that fails keeps you on the current cluster, and the error arrives as a toast with a reason code and a request id. The failed row keeps a warning dot until a check succeeds.",
              "lineHeight": 1.55,
              "fontFamily": "$--font-mono",
              "fontSize": "$--text-2xs",
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
