              "name": "capNote",
              "fill": "$--muted-foreground",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "When search + filters match nothing, the chips stay visible so the cause is obvious, the count reads 0 of 24, and the table body becomes an Empty State that names the active filters. CLEAR FILTERS resets search and chips in one step; SHOW ALL keeps the search text. A cluster with no containers at all uses the same block with DEPLOY STACK (see Foundations).",
