              "fill": "$--muted-foreground",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "PULL IMAGE opens a dialog that validates the reference before anything runs, then pulls on each target node in parallel. Each node reports its own progress; one failing node doesn't stop the others. Registry errors are shown verbatim with the fix (credentials) and a per-node RETRY. RUN IN BACKGROUND closes the dialog and hands progress to a loading toast.",
