              "content": "A deployment that fails verification rolls back automatically. The badge reads FAILED · ROLLED BACK, and a destructive alert under the header gives the cause in one sentence, what state the cluster is in now, and a request id. The failing service card turns red with its task-level reason; the timeline marks the failure and rollback steps in red and amber. RETRY DEPLOY re-runs the same commit; VIEW LOGS opens the failing task's logs at the crash.",
