              "content": "When the exec websocket drops, the tab turns red and the session freezes in place: output stays readable (dimmed), the prompt loses its cursor and input is blocked. A divider marks where the connection ended; the inline block offers RECONNECT (new shell in the same container) or CLOSE TAB. The footer names the close reason.",
