              "content": "A dropped log socket never clears the view: the tab dot turns amber, a warning alert counts reconnect attempts with backoff (RETRY NOW skips the wait), and existing lines stay put. When the client falls behind, an inline gap row says how many lines were dropped. Scrolling up pauses auto-follow; a floating pill counts new lines and JUMP TO LATEST resumes tailing.",
