              "content": "Edits are staged, not auto-saved. Changed rows get a lime tint plus 'changed from …'; invalid fields validate on blur with the reason under the input; settings that only apply after an agent restart carry a RESTART REQUIRED badge. A sticky bar counts pending changes and errors — SAVE stays disabled until every error is fixed, DISCARD reverts everything. Leaving the page with changes asks for confirmation.",
