              "content": "Saving ordinary settings just confirms with a success toast. Changing the Agent URL is different: it moves the whole session to another controller, so a non-destructive confirm dialog (neutral tile, primary button) spells out the consequences — sign-out, GitHub sign-in on the new agent, open terminals and log streams closing — before anything happens. Cancel keeps the old URL.",
